{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14215260","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14215260","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1421526001:1":{"text":"반, 얼마나 됐나 보러 왔어요!","source_cn":"瓦恩，我们来看看你的进展！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C581543EE3958DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421526002:1":{"text":"와, 정말 날카로운 보검이네요! 그 재료로 이런 검을 만들어 내다니! 치피가 보기엔 충분히 완벽해요!","source_cn":"哇，好锋利的宝剑！真想不到这是那块材料锻出来的剑！满满...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x689E2291B9FEC722","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421526003:1":{"text":"하지만 난 아직 부족한 것 같은걸...","source_cn":"可我觉得还不够……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF406665710AF1799","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1421526003":{"text":"하지만 난 아직 부족한 것 같은걸...","source_cn":"可我觉得还不够……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF406665710AF1799","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421526004:1":{"text":"이것 봐요! 마스터도 그렇게 말하잖아요! 치피와 마스터의 판단이 틀릴 리 없어요!","source_cn":"看！主人都发话啦！满满和主人两个人的判断肯定没问题！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x761261F4CE487BD1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이것 봐요! 마스터도 그렇게 말하잖아요! 치피와 마스터의 판단이 틀릴 리 없어요!","female":"이것 봐요! 마스터도 그렇게 말하잖아요! 치피와 마스터의 판단이 틀릴 리 없어요!","variant_male_record_index":"165105","variant_female_record_index":"165106","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421526005:1":{"text":"알겠어.. 그럼 여기까지 할게...","source_cn":"好吧……那我就停手了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FCC7FC1403C31D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1421526006:1":{"text":"토너먼트 1차 테스트가 종료되었습니다! 만족스럽지 않더라도 여기까지만 하셔야 합니다!","source_cn":"再不舍得停手也该停啦！淘汰赛第一阶段正式结束！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B87E9B62D6FC34A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1421526007:1":{"text":"검 원형이... 훌륭하군요. 주최측의 생각을 제대로 이해했어요!","source_cn":"我来看看这把剑胚……不错，看来你们领悟了主办方的苦心！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FC58080C87D7A57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1421526008:1":{"text":"반이 1차 테스트를 통과했습니다!","source_cn":"我宣布，瓦恩正式通过第一阶段的考验！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x294418F4DEA0DE56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1421526009:1":{"text":"이제 다음 테스트 재료를 지급하겠습니다. 바로... 이 목재입니다.","source_cn":"下面，我将发放下一阶段的材料——也就是这些木料。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8876224625F86C1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:12::2":{"text":"낡은 목재","source_cn":"破烂木材","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FD0B64B8DBB9864","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1421526010:1":{"text":"참가자는 주최측이 제공한 목재로 칼자루를 제작하고 부착해야 합니다. 1차 테스트를 경험했으니 당황하지 않겠죠?","source_cn":"参赛者需要使用主办方提供的木料制作并安装剑柄。相信你们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E58DFB04AA78B37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1421526011:0":{"text":"이 보잘것없는 나무는... 단단하지 않고, 무른 것 같네요...","source_cn":"看起来破破烂烂的……木质很疏松呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FCB6D647BA34E73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1421526012:0":{"text":"그럼 계속 대회를 준비하세요. 칼자루를 부착한 뒤 대회장에 작품을 제출하세요. 여러분의 작품이 기대되는군요. 힘내세요!","source_cn":"那么请继续准备比赛吧。剑柄安装完成后，请前往参赛场地提...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7326DE6997442656","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1421526013:0":{"text":"지난 테스트로 봐서는, 이번에도 우리가 쓸 만한 목재를 찾아내는지 시험하는 것 같네요... 치피 생각이 맞죠?","source_cn":"有了上一次的经验，这次又是在考验我们能不能从这些木料中...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80CE78B761715D92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1421526014:1":{"text":"응, 이 철력목은 겉은 무르지만 속은 특히 더 단단해. 필요 없는 부분을 제거해 볼게...","source_cn":"的确，这种铁藜木虽然边材疏松，但心材却格外坚硬，我试着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4DA5AA10AC1A413","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"이미 완벽해","source_cn":"已经完美无缺了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x622B0A70FC7DDDCF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이미 완벽해","female":"이미 완벽해","variant_male_record_index":"72974","variant_female_record_index":"72975","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瓦恩":{"text":"반","source":"瓦恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:大赛员工拉齐":{"text":"대회 직원 라지","source":"大赛员工拉齐","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":4}}